OL,3,GNEWSA'Fault' caused chlorine leak at
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "technical fault" at a leisure centre
OL,7,Fin Derby caused a chlorine leak which
OL,8,Fprompted an evacuation and saw 15
OL,9,Fpeople taken to hospital, the site's
OL,10,Foperator has confirmed.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to
OL,13,FMoorways Sports Village and Water Park
OL,14,Fin Moor Lane, Allenton, on 30 July.
OL,16,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,17,Ffirefighters detected a chlorine leak
OL,18,Fin the plant room and they ventilated
OL,19,Fthe area until there was no elevated
OL,20,Freadings.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
