OL,3,GNEWSA'Fault' caused chlorine leak at
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Morgan, area contract manager for
OL,7,FEveryone Active - which operates the
OL,8,Fsite owned by Derby City Council - said
OL,9,Ffollowing a "thorough investigation" it
OL,10,Fwas found the incident was caused by a
OL,11,Ftechnical fault in the plant room.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
